# Build context for services/api/Dockerfile is the repository root. Only package manifests and the four packages
# the image needs are COPYed; this keeps the context small and keeps local build output and env files out.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/.expo
.git
.github
bc/
docs/
infra/
prototype/
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
